### Oxide Bot Monitor - API requests
### Works with VS Code "REST Client" and JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Set @host / @token to match your .env (PORT, ADMIN_TOKEN).

@host = http://localhost:3001
@token = change-me-admin-token
@auth = Bearer {{token}}

### Health (no auth)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Overview: kill-switch + summary bar + order counts + latest package
GET {{host}}/api/overview
Authorization: {{auth}}

#####################################################################
# Orders - state machine
#####################################################################

### Create order (Idempotency-Key required). Re-send this exact request: same response, header Idempotent-Replayed: true
# @name createOrder
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0001
X-Actor: shop-webhook

{
  "externalOrderId": "SHOP-0001",
  "amount": 349,
  "currency": "THB",
  "product": "UC 600",
  "customerRef": "player#1234"
}

### Same key, different body -> 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0001

{ "externalOrderId": "SHOP-0001", "amount": 1 }

### Same externalOrderId, new key -> 200 with created=false (no duplicate order). Fields that are sent must match, else 409 ORDER_CONFLICT
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0002

{ "externalOrderId": "SHOP-0001", "amount": 349 }

### Payment confirmed -> QUEUED (send twice: second returns changed=false)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/payment-confirmed
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Get one order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Timeline (every status change with reason, bot, attempt)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/timeline
Authorization: {{auth}}

### List orders (filters: status, botId, limit, offset)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?status=QUEUED&limit=20
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Cancel (only PENDING_PAYMENT / QUEUED never taken by a bot; otherwise 409 INVALID_TRANSITION / ORDER_ALREADY_ATTEMPTED)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "customer request" }

### Manual retry of a FAILED order
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/retry
Authorization: {{auth}}

#####################################################################
# Bots
#####################################################################

### All bots (state, heartbeat, metrics, current order, latest result)
GET {{host}}/api/bots
Authorization: {{auth}}

### One bot + 24h done/failed stats
GET {{host}}/api/bots/bot-01
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Turn a bot off (ปิดบอท) - takes effect immediately for dispatch
POST {{host}}/api/bots/bot-01/commands
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "stop" }

### Turn a bot on (เปิดบอท)
POST {{host}}/api/bots/bot-01/commands
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "start" }

### Ask the agent for its status / restart it
POST {{host}}/api/bots/bot-01/commands
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "status" }

### Command history
GET {{host}}/api/bots/bot-01/commands?limit=20
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Bot logs
GET {{host}}/api/bots/bot-01/logs?limit=50
Authorization: {{auth}}

#####################################################################
# Kill-switch
#####################################################################

### Stop the whole system (ปิดทั้งระบบ)
PUT {{host}}/api/system/kill-switch
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Actor: ops-on-call

{ "engaged": true, "reason": "provider maintenance" }

### Resume (เปิดทั้งระบบ)
PUT {{host}}/api/system/kill-switch
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "engaged": false }

#####################################################################
# Code deployment
#####################################################################

### Upload a .zip package (uploading identical bytes again returns the existing package)
# @name upload
POST {{host}}/api/deployments
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----oxide

------oxide
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="oxide-bot.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./sample-package.zip
------oxide--

### List packages
GET {{host}}/api/deployments
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Update every bot (omit botIds) - repeat it: bots report already-pending / up-to-date
POST {{host}}/api/deployments/{{upload.response.body.id}}/rollout
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Update selected bots only
POST {{host}}/api/deployments/{{upload.response.body.id}}/rollout
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "botIds": ["bot-02"] }

#####################################################################
# Audit
#####################################################################

### Audit log (filters: targetType, targetId)
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?limit=50
Authorization: {{auth}}
